i vous serez absent.e \\\\u00e0 un atelier ou si vous d\\\\u00e9sirez annuler votre participation \\\\u00e0 la s\\\\u00e9rie au complet. Cela permettra \\\\u00e0 une autre personne de profiter de l\\\\u2019atelier.\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"f76a8585-5d83-402a-98be-0fa2edc899c4\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"d48c71e7-83a5-43d8-8e63-66b1351299ce\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"fb512d4d-f360-4365-addd-0c42da3f041d\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"cta\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Lien vers plateforme Amelia\\", \\"phone_number\\": \\"\\", \\"phone_text\\": \\"Lien vers plateforme Amelia\\", \\"button_text\\": \\"Pour vous inscrire \\\\u00e0 un atelier, cliquez ici!\\", \\"button_link\\": \\"\\", \\"image\\": 7}, \\"id\\": \\"0ee4964b-6e42-4ff5-b019-e27787a1d72e\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"atelier\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Cliquez sur l\\\\u2019atelier pour en apprendre davantage.\\", \\"intro\\": \\"Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry's standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.\\", \\"ateliers\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": 10, \\"id\\": \\"4f351fca-c441-402d-88b5-d5dc55ff7f85\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"c5baf3b6-341c-43f0-b3b7-e6fa338ee0c3\\"}]", "live": true, "path": "000100030004", "slug": "ateliers-thématiques", "depth": 3, "owner": 1, "title": "Ateliers thématiques", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/accueil/ateliers-thématiques/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Ateliers thématiques", "content_type": 33, "header_title": "Ateliers thématiques", "introduction": "", "live_revision": 39, "show_in_menus": false, "header_subtitle": "Ateliers thématiques périnataux", "latest_revision": 45, "translation_key": "b2f6121d-95d7-41cc-b2d6-d1aada084ee0", "show_page_header": true, "header_background": 4, "last_p