230	2025-10-18 17:12:14.921075-04	{"pk": 58, "body": "[{\\"type\\": \\"paragraphs\\", \\"value\\": {\\"paragraphs\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"er534\\\\\\">La formation continue s\\\\u2019adresse \\\\u00e0 tous les types d\\\\u2019accompagnant.e.s ou intervenant.e.s en p\\\\u00e9rinatalit\\\\u00e9, ainsi qu\\\\u2019aux \\\\u00e9tudiant.e.s d\\\\u2019Alternative Naissance. Il se peut que des personnes provenant de l\\\\u2019ext\\\\u00e9rieur de l\\\\u2019organisme soient \\\\u00e9galement invit\\\\u00e9.e.s, selon la formation offerte.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"c78d9910-0210-4778-b064-c346f7c835d8\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"d3tsn\\\\\\">Toutes les heures cumul\\\\u00e9es lors de ces formations continues s\\\\u2019ins\\\\u00e8rent dans le cursus des formations reconnues par l\\\\u2019ANQ et RITMA. Lorsque votre certification est compl\\\\u00e9t\\\\u00e9e aupr\\\\u00e8s de ces instances, il vous est possible d\\\\u2019\\\\u00e9mettre des re\\\\u00e7us pour les personnes que vous accompagnez.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"e197519f-6b11-41d6-8e5d-79d968627872\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"d3tsn\\\\\\">Nous vous encourageons \\\\u00e0 consulter r\\\\u00e9guli\\\\u00e8rement le calendrier et \\\\u00e0 vous inscrire \\\\u00e0 ces formations qui stimuleront votre pratique.</p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"e259bbbf-1966-484a-abe2-8a2681d32f6a\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"4b4775b2-3e03-4c50-9d4d-a1ab2c9c89b1\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"calendar_events\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Calendrier des activit\\\\u00e9s\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"dfce18aa-d29a-4e86-a46e-e29239a97fe7\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"dynamic_table\\", \\"value\\": {\\"title\\": \\"Annulation de votre pr\\\\u00e9sence\\", \\"rows\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"cells\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": {\\"content\\": \\"Nous avons \\\\u00e0 c\\\\u0153ur de vous offrir ces formations de qualit\\\\u00e9. Par respect pour le travail de nos formateurs.trices, merci de nous aviser de votre incapacit\\\\u00e9 \\\\u00e0 participer dans un d\\\\u00e9lai de 72 heures avant la formation. Cela permettra \\\\u00e0 une autre personne de participer \\\\u00e0 la formation.\\"}, \\"id\\": \\"3a8e5846-abca-4372-85ed-4f6f13e8bcd9\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"e6bc62c4-2611-40a7-977b-314742f12620\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"6402177a-43c7-4399-846b-5e72f5505bb6\\"}, {\\"type\\": \\"paragraphs\\", \\"value\\": {\\"paragraphs\\": [{\\"type\\": \\"item\\", \\"value\\": \\"<p data-block-key=\\\\\\"7u4ik\\\\\\"><b>Pour vous inscrire \\\\u00e0 une formation, cliquez ici.</b></p>\\", \\"id\\": \\"b7b6553f-b744-4522-8b9b-eb8556bed2e9\\"}]}, \\"id\\": \\"449c6bb8-36a2-40ba-b093-2fcb4e413906\\"}]", "live": false, "path": "00010003001F", "slug": "formation-continue", "depth": 3, "owner": 1, "title": "Formation continue", "locale": 1, "locked": false, "expired": false, "alias_of": null, "numchild": 0, "url_path": "/accueil/formation-continue/", "expire_at": null, "locked_at": null, "locked_by": null, "seo_title": "", "go_live_at": null, "draft_title": "Formation continue", "content_type": 33, "header_title": "Formation continue", "introduction": "", "live_revision": null, "show_in_menus": false, "header_subtitle": "Formation continue", "latest_revision": 229, "translation_key": "8ef54976-748d-486b-85de-98086d3717c9", "show_page_header": true, "header_background": 4, "last_published_at": null, "first_published_at": null, "search_description": "", "wagtail_admin_comments": [], "has_unpublished_changes": true, "latest_revision_created_at": "2025-10-18T21:11:50.296Z"}	\N	58	1	33	1	Formation continue
